      "blocks": {
        "ordering_delivery": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Ordering & delivery",
            "open_by_default": true,
            "open_first_question": true,
            "question_1": "Are these pieces already made, or built after I order?",
            "answer_1": "<p>Almost everything is made to order. Once your order and any customization details are confirmed, artisans begin your piece — which is why an order spends roughly 15 to 20 business days in processing and production before it ships.</p>",
            "question_2": "How long until my piece arrives?",
            "answer_2": "<p>For orders within the United States, plan on roughly <strong>18 to 25 business days</strong> in total: about 15 to 20 business days of processing and production, then about 3 to 5 business days in transit. Oversized, customized, or specially handled pieces can take longer, and we tell you if that applies to yours.</p>",
            "question_3": "Is shipping really included?",
            "answer_3": "<p>Yes. Complimentary standard shipping is included on every order delivered to an eligible United States address, with no minimum order value. Optional extras such as expedited transport, installation, or storage are quoted separately and always confirmed with you before anything is booked.</p>"
          }
        },
        "returns_condition": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Returns & condition",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "open_first_question": false,
            "question_1": "Can I return a piece if I change my mind?",
            "answer_1": "<p>No. All WRYDECO purchases are final sale. We cannot accept returns, exchanges, or refunds for a change of mind, a different finish preference, or a piece that does not fit the space after delivery. Please check dimensions carefully, and speak to us before ordering if anything is uncertain — that is exactly what our consultation is for.</p>",
            "question_2": "What happens if my piece arrives damaged?",
            "answer_2": "<p>Contact us within <strong>7 calendar days</strong> of delivery with clear photographs of both the piece and its packaging. We will review the claim and arrange an appropriate resolution. Please do not send anything back before we have given you written instructions.</p>",
            "question_3": "",
            "answer_3": ""
          }
        },
        "before_you_choose": {
          "type": "category",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Before you choose",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "open_first_question": false,
            "question_1": "Will mine look exactly like the photographs?",
            "answer_1": "<p>The design and proportions will match. The wood will not. Every board carries its own grain, tone, and knots, so your piece will be recognisably the same design and unmistakably its own object. Screen calibration and room lighting also change how a finish reads.</p>",
            "question_2": "Can I speak to someone before committing to a piece?",
            "answer_2": "<p>Yes, and we would rather you did. A private consultation is complimentary, runs 30 minutes, and carries no obligation to buy. Slots open daily at 9AM, 1PM, and 8PM Asia/Saigon time, can be booked up to a week ahead, and need at least three hours notice. It is most useful when you are deciding between pieces, working with an awkward wall or ceiling height, or weighing up a standard design against a commission.</p>",
            "question_3": "",
            "answer_3": ""
          }
        }
